{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788378923955047001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"francium-written-squid","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":8,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"bf3c81cb8c6b246b3ff57cb9822b734faec9b4b01ea49f5002a9dac5510407a6","event_uuid":"cc60d129-a0c0-4e5e-92e3-ef99241bfe44","position":{"commit_sha":"5cc1cbabfef5dbec40fd626de9424734d9498277","position":"1788375027119321123-cc60d129-a0c0-4e5e-92e3-ef99241bfe44"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"cf2b3c33fffe9fb15aa5905785c7ec5447e8912b14e98956d25547b76e4d1d13","event_uuid":"95f141f3-f52b-491e-8616-dfc8b122c171","position":{"commit_sha":"9d8dd458d63ffaefc4ede525b9e59b43ddab8b1f","position":"1788375088045870281-95f141f3-f52b-491e-8616-dfc8b122c171"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"2b0fa60497f3aa6010796af407eef628403d66a01d7fe2d940e21379285ffc23","event_uuid":"e99778ad-21a6-40a0-a335-eb38d5eda4bc","position":{"commit_sha":"9b7e35f772a5ccd4753d6b2a5bb6131c4735f2a7","position":"1788375178662058177-e99778ad-21a6-40a0-a335-eb38d5eda4bc"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"0571831e3b5bfc24ef149ff2b68e555a3ba090a76f8f50dac437bd77be2693f5","event_uuid":"a6eacef8-1d73-4697-9d52-df805c1d64ed","position":{"commit_sha":"fb6c6933b0d35ccd3a9cb098c7663ae341b3934b","position":"1788375230066152437-a6eacef8-1d73-4697-9d52-df805c1d64ed"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"a316f8fe6f5f962e4353c2ecc82873d493c182d42a2232b905174caa5b8f3060","event_uuid":"5b12714d-2908-4b26-b3a3-26b7473b901b","position":{"commit_sha":"afe154d8bf4a489b448e660e5d3339f51177b560","position":"1788375728360022944-5b12714d-2908-4b26-b3a3-26b7473b901b"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"5ff3ec25f680ac4cd05123e0c923cbb8a8808289d68cbfaa2abba6e9989659a4","event_uuid":"a9edd455-0eed-477b-ac4a-cd65901bc38a","position":{"commit_sha":"6d6c97c99cdb457c892d59adcc706036044e24d6","position":"1788375841860279727-a9edd455-0eed-477b-ac4a-cd65901bc38a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"51d35b1f8f2ef7f9b8724749eefb4952434b25bc16b9608c924666ab3e1fc357","event_uuid":"19110552-0a70-48ff-a84b-4b93f0daf024","position":{"commit_sha":"e62d8427d76ecc0010c15cc11bba158c7c487cb3","position":"1788375888492128126-19110552-0a70-48ff-a84b-4b93f0daf024"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"e3f927e0703ce9956271d8ad1c4cddad6d0c3ab3545e981653d76b62867a5f79","event_uuid":"444809f3-c287-4408-994e-f8879ffdd0f6","position":{"commit_sha":"2af042c53a996541ee07ecf4618d7e52677299a2","position":"1788376362848572066-444809f3-c287-4408-994e-f8879ffdd0f6"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788375027119321123,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[],"description":"# S5 — Bound writable container layers and alarm on exited-container debris\n\n## Why\nWritable container layers can accumulate independently from BuildKit cache and image layers. Without a distinct cap/metric, exited-container debris can consume root while the operator only sees generic root pressure.\n\n## What\nBound writable container layer growth. Prefer a Docker/runtime-supported storage quota when compatible with current overlay2/root filesystem; otherwise install a bounded periodic reaper for exited containers using Docker APIs such as `docker container prune --filter until=...`. Add observability for writable/exited-container footprint and a dedicated CloudWatch alarm at/near cap.\n\n## Scope\nIn scope: runtime quota or stopped-container reaper, safety checks for live compose services and persistent volumes, metric emission, Terraform alarm, runbook updates, and tests. Out of scope: direct `/var/lib/docker/overlay2` deletion, BuildKit cache cap, journald, `/var/tmp`, and review scratch volume.\n\n## Grounding\n- Docker overlay2 docs describe writable container layers as the container `upperdir`/`diff` under `/var/lib/docker/overlay2` and warn Docker owns `/var/lib/docker`.\n- Docker CLI docs support `docker container prune --filter until=...` for stopped containers.\n- Compose services use persistent named/bind volumes for source-of-truth state, so stopped-container cleanup can be safe when scoped through Docker APIs.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Writable container layer accumulation has an enforced bound or documented runtime quota; stopped-container cleanup is bounded and safe.\n- [ ] Running containers, persistent named/bind volumes, and rollback images are not removed by the reaper.\n- [ ] Observability emits writable/exited-container layer usage/cap metrics and Terraform declares a dedicated alarm wired to SNS.\n- [ ] Runbook explains diagnosis/remediation and forbids manual overlay2 deletion.\n- [ ] Targeted tests cover prune command construction/safety, metric emission, and alarm wiring.\n- [ ] Portability criterion: solution uses Docker runtime APIs and local tests; no CI-provider-specific dependency is introduced.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh","reason":"Add bounded stopped-container/writable-layer reaping if implemented in autodeploy path."},{"path":"infra/scripts/compose-up.sh","reason":"Install Docker runtime storage quota config or cleanup timer if needed."},{"path":"infra/scripts/observability.sh","reason":"Publish writable/exited-container layer usage/cap metric."},{"path":"infra/terraform/monitoring_autodeploy.tf","reason":"Add writable-container-layer saturation CloudWatch alarm."},{"path":"infra/runbooks/review-bot-ops.md","reason":"Document safe container-layer remediation and no manual overlay2 deletion."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_autodeploy_prune.py","reason":"Cover container prune/reaper safety."},{"path":"tests/scripts/test_observability_disk_pressure.py","reason":"Cover writable/exited-container metric emission."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_alarm_actions_terraform.py","reason":"Assert new alarm action wiring."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["blocks","e956-b1c3-45b9-4016"],["parent","6202-e1c7-c57f-4897"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"6202-e1c7-c57f-4897","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["infra","gerrit","disk-ceiling","containers"],"ticket_id":"910b-2d43-4482-4c64","ticket_type":"story","title":"S5 — Bound writable container layers and alarm on exited-container debris","verify_commands":[{"command":"env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest -q tests/unit/test_autodeploy_prune.py tests/scripts/test_observability_disk_pressure.py tests/unit/test_alarm_actions_terraform.py","dd_id":"AC3","dd_text":"Writable container layer reaping, metrics, and alarms are covered."},{"command":"terraform -chdir=infra/terraform validate","dd_id":"AC4","dd_text":"Terraform syntax remains valid."}]},"source_event_uuids":["cc60d129-a0c0-4e5e-92e3-ef99241bfe44","95f141f3-f52b-491e-8616-dfc8b122c171","e99778ad-21a6-40a0-a335-eb38d5eda4bc","a6eacef8-1d73-4697-9d52-df805c1d64ed","5b12714d-2908-4b26-b3a3-26b7473b901b","a9edd455-0eed-477b-ac4a-cd65901bc38a","19110552-0a70-48ff-a84b-4b93f0daf024","444809f3-c287-4408-994e-f8879ffdd0f6"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788378923955047001,"uuid":"60698930-a0c4-42be-aec3-d4c9fea4f7c4"}